{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：17:32 2026-09-29 HKT</p>\n\n<p>香港網球「一哥」黃澤林（Coleman）轉戰名古屋亞運即旗開得勝。前日剛於ATP250杭州公開賽打入8強、並力戰前世界第一兼美網冠軍美韋迪夫（Daniil Medvedev）的黃澤林，今日（29日）出戰今屆亞運男單首仗，結果以6：4、6：1直落兩盤擊敗約旦球手艾馬沙利（AL-MASHNI Zaid），順利晉身16強，下一圈將硬撼東道主日本球手綿貫陽介。</p>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林亞運首戰輕鬆取勝。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/65481d63fe7c418fdf2aba55bfc2800e/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_17_24_50_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林亞運首戰輕鬆取勝。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3eb2a59864077950bb74fe00281ae543/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_17_24_50.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林亞運首戰輕鬆取勝。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/702d1c19d0dadce2c6afe99062ebf86f/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_17_24_49_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林亞運首戰輕鬆取勝。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a31432caf1f0d1b5827e853da0f1ec98/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_17_24_49_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林亞運首戰輕鬆取勝。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5726f8e056ec4fc3febc5bd1ece1916e/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_17_24_49.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林亞運首戰輕鬆取勝。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ea0ee2db1c6f3a9bdc91610d62bbe2fb/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_17_24_48_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林亞運首戰輕鬆取勝。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/346840930fd8837aceda723107239202/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_17_24_48_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林亞運首戰輕鬆取勝。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1aa71be9581cc70d856090c028dc2871/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_17_24_48.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林亞運首戰輕鬆取勝。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0fd5a9c54c35f3ee6d5819fe3c3f8858/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_17_24_47_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林亞運首戰輕鬆取勝。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a0cc06e903f2c6d9a4c50fc18f0ad24e/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_17_24_47.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林亞運首戰輕鬆取勝。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d81bbbe729476735b8a1bdec55b2982/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_17_24_46_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林亞運首戰輕鬆取勝。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f8f77635f7c61c25af76203aa487043f/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_17_24_46_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林亞運首戰輕鬆取勝。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5bcb0b4a771b48f1330a41d98213c1be/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_17_24_46.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林亞運首戰輕鬆取勝。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e8d454ddf35b185b29c940a9a595de8/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_17_24_45_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林亞運首戰輕鬆取勝。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f10b2c6d99acd673736faa256d9dfa8d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_17_24_45_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林亞運首戰輕鬆取勝。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/af6911fe41677e8f99a45960a99aad59/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_17_24_45.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林亞運首戰輕鬆取勝。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2f457a68b75e8513371eb39de1de2682/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_17_24_44_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林亞運首戰輕鬆取勝。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ef348b635bd3bfbc9eb3b7e4ef537dbd/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_17_24_44.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林亞運首戰輕鬆取勝。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/123b9179c31126b553a4706cbc052041/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_17_24_43_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃澤林亞運首戰輕鬆取勝。劉駿軒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/46e0f63237008a53b8dc88b057fc2a24/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-29_at_17_24_43_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<p>受天雨影響，今日名古屋亞運網球多場賽事移師名古屋市東山公園室內網球場舉行。列為男單頭號種子的黃澤林首圈輪空，今日下午約3時半在次圈亮相。剛從杭州馬不停蹄轉戰名古屋的他，首盤以6：4先拔頭籌。進入第二盤後，黃澤林完全控制戰局，開局即成功破發，氣勢愈打愈盛；及至最後一局，他再度攻破對手發球局，以6：1鎖定勝局，全場僅花1小時9分鐘便奏捷。他下一圈將面對東道主球手綿貫陽介，力爭再下一城。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T09:39:27.260310+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":396,"images":20,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}